    "description": "<h2 class=\"category-title-68c font-semibold py-0 text-xl pt-2xs lg_pt-5 px-5 lg_px-4 3xl_px-0 lg_px-0 category-categoryTitle--QR leading-snug text-colorDefault text-left text-xl\" style=\"text-align: center\" aria-live=\"polite\">Buy Vape Starter Kits Online Australia</h2>\r\n<div class=\"category-description-W4t font-normal text-gray-shade1 leading-[30px] text-[18px] text-left py-2xs lg_py-5 px-5 lg_px-4 3xl_px-0 lg_px-0 category-notExpanded-FUY\">\r\n<div class=\"category-notExpanded-FUY\">A starter kit is perfect for anyone wanting to get into vaping in New Zealand and Australia. It provides all the features you need and easy to use. A majority of starter kits only has one button to operate and does not require extensive knowledge on how to operate.</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">Vape Advanced Kits are any vaping devices that provide users with more customizations especially in terms of power output and adjustable settings. They are generally much larger than vape starter kits and usually require external batteries to operate due to the power needed to operate them. It is perfect for anyone wanting more than just nicotine satisfaction.</div>\r\n</div>",
